# R8A1 ("Order") zone 7, the heaviest garden zone: 60 s baseline standing still in god mode, then 48 aggressive Strikers
# spawned in four groups of 12 in front of the player, 60 s under that load, then the enemies are cleared. Run PresentMon
# alongside; the command times in the console run's commands.jsonl split its CSV and ForgeDevelopment's performance log
# into the two halves. Needs a session started from any package; it drops into R8A1 itself.
level 35 1 0
god on
teleport zone=0/MainLayer/7 area=0 as=zone7
wait 5s
player as=zone7_pos
wait 60s
spawn Striker 12 at=front:6 as=load1
spawn Striker 12 at=front:9 as=load2
spawn Striker 12 at=front:12 as=load3
spawn Striker 12 at=front:15 as=load4
enemies as=load_count
wait 60s
enemies as=load_count_end
clear enemies
wait 5s
